Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.41,0:00:08.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,My bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:16.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell did I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:18.28,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Star in my videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:23.16,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,If you do, I can make videos \Nthat no one's seen before!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:27.02,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,I bet I could reach a million \Nsubscribers in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:27.92,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.67,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,I want you to join me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:34.97,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,In exchange, once we hit a million subs...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:37.47,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Make a meal of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:47.23,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.29,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Let's get you to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.63,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:02.24,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:03.79,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Can you stand? And walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.64,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:11.38,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:13.88,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,That green hair is so sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:16.11,FlashbackItalics,Live,0,0,0,,She looks so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.11,0:01:18.58,FlashbackItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I think I'm about to lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:21.39,FlashbackItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Wanna drink her up so bad, so bad, \Nso bad, so bad, so bad, so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:22.76,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:24.58,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Do we have any open rooms—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:27.02,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.02,0:01:28.89,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,L-Live-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.89,0:01:30.18,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:33.54,Flashback,Fu,0,0,0,,Ichiko-chan reverted to a bat \Nfrom blood deprivation!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:35.82,Flashback,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It's okay, Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:40.62,Flashback,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama went off to go find blood for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:43.37,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It totally slipped my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.37,0:01:46.01,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah! A talking bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.54,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(234,1)\fs40\bord2\shad2\fnArial Black\c&HEA2FEF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H736B81&\pos(320.5,48)}Whoo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:48.54,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll give you blood, so let me \Nget you on camera later!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:50.58,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go on. Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:53.31,Flashback,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:53.67,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(277,1)\fs40\fnComic Sans MS\c&H7547EC&\4c&H8E9383&\shad2\pos(250,10)}Chomp!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:55.26,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, that freakin' hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:56.97,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:58.35,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.35,0:01:59.59,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,I said that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:04.06,Flashback,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm back in action!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:06.34,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:07.61,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:10.04,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Why do {\i1}you{\i0} get to taste her first?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:12.03,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're so angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:13.57,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,M-Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.57,0:02:15.25,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Hey, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:16.73,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,We made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:18.14,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,But Ichiko just got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:19.09,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:19.66,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.43,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,If we hit a million subs for our channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:25.79,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,you can suck me bone-dry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:28.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I made one hell of a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:29.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.45,0:02:30.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:33.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Thinking about it, can you even \Ntake videos of vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.96,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Or, well, did any of that really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:39.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I need water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:42.05,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,What about all this equipment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.05,0:02:44.05,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we talk it over with Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.38,0:02:46.34,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,I bet she doesn't even need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:48.06,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.56,0:02:54.32,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\c&H42403E&\3c&H42403E&\pos(444.5,117)\blur0.2\t(2612,2945,\blur0.8)}Garlic {\3c&H363636&}Paste
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.56,0:02:54.32,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\c&H181714&\pos(444.5,117)\blur0.2\t(2612,2945,\blur0.8)}Garlic {\3c&H363636&}Paste
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:54.01,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:55.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:58.53,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,We've decided to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.53,0:02:59.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:02.93,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,We're pulling out all the\N stops to step things up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:03.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Step...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:05.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:41.26,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2D4146&\clip(116,1,208.5,92)\t(26,234,\clip(116,1,608.5,92))}Starting a Channel!\NGood Morning from the Dead of Night!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.76,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\b0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H406696&\pos(447.5,45.5)}Live's house <3
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.76,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\b0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H406696&\pos(434.5,207.5)}Take first crossing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.76,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\b0\fnComic Sans MS\c&H406696&\pos(269.5,273.5)}Train station
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is this really the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,There's nothing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.03,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's like a nature trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:02.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Welcome to Banpai Manor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:07.37,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Once again, I'm Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:08.99,Default,Live,0,0,0,,She's Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:12.29,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama's wish is my command! \NI'll give it all I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:13.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And this is Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:19.62,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Fu's a bit shy, but I'll see \Nto it that she does her part!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:21.88,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I'll do my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:22.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:25.00,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.36,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,A human finding out about us...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:28.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.05,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll make it work somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.39,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.69,0:05:32.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now, then—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.37,0:05:34.14,Default,Live,0,0,0,,First, let's get one thing straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:37.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,A million subs, and I suck out \Nyour bone marrow! Okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:38.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Bone marrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.40,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(271,227)\fnArial Black\fs40\pos(212.5,10)\c&H3BFFF4&\4c&HEA385A&\shad3\xshad-3}Bone
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.40,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,227)\fnArial Black\fs40\c&H3BFFF4&\4c&HEA385A&\shad3\pos(384.5,10)}Dry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, what I said was "bone-dry"...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:44.14,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You don't mind, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:45.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,If I suck you completely dry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:46.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Completely?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.78,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You don't mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:51.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fine, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:52.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If we hit the goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,There, you said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:54.88,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You totally said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:57.49,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko! Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:59.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Devote yourselves for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:00.46,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.95,0:06:00.46,DefaultTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:03.85,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,W-Won't hitting a million subs be really hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.34,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:07.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki's got it all worked out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:08.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,She'll get us there in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.72,0:06:09.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Right, Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:11.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:15.55,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Duh, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We're unstoppable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:20.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We're talking my ideas, {\i1}plus{\i0} vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:22.53,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's get cracking right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:24.61,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll do it. I'll get big in no time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:28.75,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,and show those two what's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:30.99,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(152,152)\bord3\an9\c&H7E7E7C&\3c&HF1F5F2&}Chu-Chu Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:34.45,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fad(1,766)\an7\c&H5A2BD4&\3c&HF3F3F3&\bord2\blur0.6\pos(46.5,19)}Chu-Chu Pops\N{\c&HCBB275&}While Flying {\c&H2F3327&}#1
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.53,0:06:34.45,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(821,766)\fs12\pos(320,282.5)\blur2}* This video was shot using special\Neffects. Don't try this at home <3
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.53,0:06:34.45,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(821,766)\fs12\pos(320,282.5)\blur0.2}* This video was shot using special\Neffects. Don't try this at home <3
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:41.55,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,First, to attract viewer attention, \Nwe'll upload tons of short videos!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:46.30,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let's see what vampire powers can do, \Nand try this, that, and everything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:48.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:50.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can you vampires fly faster than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.20,0:06:53.82,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Yes, I can fly much faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.82,0:06:55.07,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:56.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:05.70,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Compared to the Hype-Sis days,\N it's a lot harder to get numbers on NewTube now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.31,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnArial Black\an7\c&HAD1B60&\3c&HF3F3F3&\bord1.5\blur0.6\pos(277.5,229)}Chu-Chu Pops in\N{\c&H4E28A7&}High Places #6
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:03.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\fnArial Black\an7\c&H3BC6A2&\3c&HE8E8E8&\bord1.5\blur0.6\pos(47,81)}Chu-Chu Pops\N{\c&HCC8C45&}While Flying #7
