Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:21.43,Signs_Boxed,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\3c&H9249D8&\bord2\pos(318.5,94)}Your latest video has been viewed 503,731 times since it was published.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:19.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In just three weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Maybe I {\i1}am{\i0} a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:27.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Which means the million-sub mark \Nis right around the corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:30.66,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki-tan, you'll be all mine soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:31.50,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Where do I start?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:33.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Where should I bite you first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.23,0:08:34.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's too soon for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:36.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's start our next shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.16,0:08:37.23,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Right-o!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:38.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What kind of video are we making today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:42.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why, now that all eyes are on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:43.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,we'll make our most over-the-top video yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.23,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Over-the-top?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.90,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it if you'd refrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.25,0:08:49.13,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.01,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,These childish videos...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:57.84,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,end now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.52,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's been twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.97,0:09:05.64,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You finally wake up, and here you are, \Nfraternizing with a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.64,0:09:07.81,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Shut up, Shigeyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.27,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:11.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is she a vampire, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:12.11,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:16.78,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Yuki-sama and Live-sama are higher \Non the vampire hierarchy than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:18.91,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,P-Please, have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:20.57,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.57,0:09:23.06,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Here's a fresh supply of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:24.99,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.99,0:09:28.25,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I-Isn't it a little soon, though?\NI was expecting you next week—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You can never have too much, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.39,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Th-That's absolutely true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.39,0:09:35.61,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It beats running out and having \Nto go search a hospital like before!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:36.56,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:39.30,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Well, that hospital turned out \Nto be abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:42.42,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Raiding an abandoned hospital for blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:45.93,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I don't believe I was ever informed of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.44,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I see. You were hiding it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:55.57,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Not only did you bring a human here, \Nyou tried to steal their blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:00.21,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're going to make a \Nbig deal over just that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:01.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Still a stickler, I see, Shige—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:02.58,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,My name is Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:05.20,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Just that, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.25,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You're flagrantly breaking the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:10.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I didn't end up stealing any blood, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:13.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And I was going to tell you \Nall about Masaki sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:15.22,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Tell me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:18.34,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Even if we were to assume that \Nwas up for discussion...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:20.59,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,How exactly do you explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:20.59,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz5.04\pos(344,255)}Subscribe
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:20.59,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz5.04\c&H888B89&\pos(265.5,17)}Chu-Chu Girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:22.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,A message from Mother:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:27.81,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Erase the channel, \Nor you'll be the ones erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:33.17,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Actions that reveal our powers to the public \Nare strictly prohibited above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.94,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,You've greatly angered Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:37.73,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:38.68,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Then be obedient and—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:39.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:41.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Delete the channel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:42.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:47.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Thanks to {\i1}my{\i0} awesome ideas, \Nwe now have an amazing opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:47.87,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:49.77,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Stop, Masaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:51.50,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,How dare you, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.27,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Don't try it, Shige!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:01.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Eat this, vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.97,0:11:00.22,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(144,144)\fs30\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H26263B&\3c&HEEF9F3&}Garlic Paste
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.38,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,D-Damn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.52,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.77,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,feed me garlic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:11.66,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Feed me garlic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:21.69,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Wowie...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:23.03,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:27.24,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,To think I was surrounded by flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:30.26,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,These tulips get my two lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:31.31,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:32.24,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:34.56,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,There are pit traps all around me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:35.55,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:37.74,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Trying to humiliate me, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:39.55,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let's play a game of tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:41.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So that's what garlic does to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:40.93,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.51,DefaultTop,Yuki,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:46.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, now that she's out of the way, \Nlet's get shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:49.02,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Delete the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:51.02,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We can't go against Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Y-You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.70,0:11:54.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I would never dream of deleting the—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Delete it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:57.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We're just getting started here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:11:59.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:00.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.26,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Delete it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.95,0:12:10.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Looks like those magical \Ntwo weeks are over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.86,0:12:15.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.45,0:12:17.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,They're not here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:21.59,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\pos(345.5,20)}Lily\NSuch a nice house! I'd love to live there\N\NKitsuOto Girl\NGood luck, you two!\N\Nno signal\NIt's so much better now that Masakichi's gone\N\NStrawberry Milk\NWhat a lovely place...! All your hard effort has...\N\Nanna\NCongrats on the move! A house with two cuties\Nis guaranteed to be just as cute~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:27.10,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fad(484,1)\fnArial Black\c&H8EC7DA&\3c&HDCF1FB&\4c&HA4909E&\bord2\shad2}Big Reveal: {\4c&H646CB0&}Our New House
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:30.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.18,0:12:36.41,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Boy, making videos sure was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:38.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki! Masaki's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:40.28,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.40,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,FML!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:44.06,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Now I'll never get to suck Masaki's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:46.36,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Farewell, my lovely bone marrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:50.51,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,No, I can't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:52.54,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,How's Masaki holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.12,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Is she angry at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:57.23,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I don't blame her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:59.20,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Do I apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.20,0:13:02.30,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Even if I did, would she forgive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:05.05,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ugh, there's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.05,0:13:06.11,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:07.80,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Is your scalp itchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:09.46,DefaultTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Should we change shampoos?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:09.20,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:10.31,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,What can I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:15.24,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,Agh, I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:17.31,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I have no idea, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:19.19,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,I want to see Masaki again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.37,0:13:23.19,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:29.20,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(271,1)\fs14\pos(321.5,21)}pandamaru\NMasakichi was so annoying. I'm glad she's gone.\N\NManatee Tears\NSo did Masakichi end up just running away?\N\Notake3\NYou know it's over when all the comments on\Nsocial media are bashing her.\NShow me the Masakichi white knights lol\N\NYaminabe\Nthe masakichi scandal is so hilarious lmao\Nall those delicious tears\N\NChicken Nanban Lunch\NDid Masakichi-san apologize on her knees yet??\N\NWombats Own\NThis is what happens when you get full of yourself.\N#MasakichiScandal\N\NChappie\Ncya masakichi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:32.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm all alone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:46.67,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I ended up coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.59,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:52.81,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why don't you start by letting me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:55.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We vampires can't enter a \Ndwelling unless we're invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.73,0:13:57.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:58.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go away. Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.49,0:13:59.23,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:05.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You and I are through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:09.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Can I ask you one last thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:10.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:15.10,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why do you care so much about making videos?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:15.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:19.20,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I mean, we had fun making them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:22.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But you're like, dead serious about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:23.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:26.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:27.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sure it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I want to know all about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:30.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Tell me! How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:43.26,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Until high school, \NI found everything to be a hassle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:45.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,so I spent all my time watching videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.86,0:14:49.54,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,What? Who're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:50.85,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:53.16,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,Kikka and Otomi, from your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:54.73,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.40,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:56.33,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.97,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.97,0:14:59.71,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.71,0:15:02.09,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Maybe you think I'm lonely without friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:03.46,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,but I choose to be all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:07.50,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,We like watching the same videos as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:10.02,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,I even subscribe to their channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:11.31,Flashback,Otomi,0,0,0,,They're so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:13.64,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,We don't know anyone else who watches them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:14.72,Flashback,Kikka,0,0,0,,So we wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.05,0:15:17.16,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Really? How long have \Nyou been watching them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.16,0:15:18.57,FlashbackTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Which videos do you like the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:21.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Videos were what brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:28.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We became friends and decided \Nto try making our own videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:30.99,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1530,1)\fs30\fnArial Black\c&H1D47D7&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.5\shad2}Buying All the {\c&H6C31C9&\4c&H3F22B3&\bord2}Mars Gummies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:30.99,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,By sheer luck, they happened to go viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:33.01,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:36.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It felt like we'd found approval \Nfrom so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:39.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So we made up our minds
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:42.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,to follow in the footsteps of the \NNewTubers who brought us together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:45.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and set a goal of one million subscribers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:47.69,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's the reason I worked so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:52.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd end up deleting \Nthe Chu-Chu Girls channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:55.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's like there's a higher power \Ntelling me not to make videos—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:57.06,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Why not just make them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:58.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:16:00.68,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Make videos with us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We can't let it get out that we're vampires,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:06.10,Default,Live,0,0,0,,but no one said we can't make more videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:09.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,B-But we'll never get good numbers unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.70,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Teach us how to make videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:15.48,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Teach us all there is to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:18.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And let's make them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:19.43,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Starting from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.90,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You've got me to help you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:32.87,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:40.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You can come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.81,0:16:45.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You have my invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:49.52,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,She's taking so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:52.12,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Where could Live-sama have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,It's almost morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:56.03,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Let's call it a night and go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:16:58.24,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'll wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:01.86,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:03.33,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.42,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,And... Masaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko! Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.36,0:17:09.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We're gonna make videos again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:10.42,Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:14.28,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,B-But surely Yuki-sama will find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:15.93,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:18.59,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We won't use any vampire powers this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:20.06,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Even then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.31,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Ichiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:24.18,Default,Live,0,0,0,,How are you going to pay back \Nthose debts of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:28.48,Default,Live,0,0,0,,If we hit a million subs, \Nthat solves everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:29.80,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I-I see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:33.32,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama is putting herself in danger \Nwith these videos for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.55,DefaultItalics,Live,0,0,0,,All for Masaki's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:36.65,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.22,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That's the Ichiko I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:40.97,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.44,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,You're helping too, Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:45.53,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:48.52,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Well, I found it fun as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:50.59,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:52.89,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:54.77,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What do we need to do first?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:56.36,Default,Live,0,0,0,,You're gonna teach us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H696D6A&\pos(222.5,59.5)}Create an Eagle Account
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H696D6A&\pos(269.5,169)}Step 1: Choose an Eagle Account type
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs10\3c&HE37E62&\pos(163.5,200)}For myself
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\fs10\3c&HE37E62&\pos(245,200)}To manage a business
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:02.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,First, we need to create a channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:02.72,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H696D6A&\pos(372,78)}Create an Eagle Account
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:02.72,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\c&H696D6A&\pos(166,131)}Last name
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:02.72,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\c&H696D6A&\pos(260,131)}First name
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:01.01,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H696D6A&\pos(203,143.5)}So{\alpha&HFF&}noue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.01,0:18:01.10,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H696D6A&\pos(203,143.5)}Sono{\alpha&HFF&}ue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:01.18,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H696D6A&\pos(203,143.5)}Sonou{\alpha&HFF&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.18,0:18:02.72,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H696D6A&\pos(203,143.5)}Sonoue
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:01.76,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H696D6A&\pos(299.5,143.5)}Ma{\alpha&HFF&}saki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.76,0:18:01.93,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H696D6A&\pos(299.5,143.5)}Masa{\alpha&HFF&}ki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:02.72,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&H696D6A&\pos(299.5,143.5)}Masaki
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:06.87,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Might as well make a new \Naccount and log in. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.87,0:18:11.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then click on "Create new channel" here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:12.86,Default,Live,0,0,0,,A new channel name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:13.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:16.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We can't use the name Chu-Chu Girls anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:17.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.88,Default,Group,0,0,0,,A channel name...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:23.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,How did you come up with \Nthe name Hyped-Up Sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:25.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In our case...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.87,0:18:31.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We thought as a group about \Nwhat kind of channel we wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:33.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and shared our suggestions....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:34.39,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.09,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Everyone come up with a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:37.94,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:40.76,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Then I suggest Thrills 'n' Kicks, Ready, Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:41.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.13,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:44.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's not a kids' channel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:46.29,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Your turn, Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:46.93,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:50.73,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I think a relaxing-sounding \Nchannel name would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:53.94,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,The 12 a.m. Aged Hyaluronic Acid Channel—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:53.94,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:55.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Way too quirky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:56.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It just sounds bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.72,0:18:58.03,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What's that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.50,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I quit after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.50,0:19:00.45,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Hold your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:01.95,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's fine, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.89,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll come up with a good name!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:05.99,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,You're up next, Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:11.96,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:15.87,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We can only go out late at night (mayonaka),
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.87,0:19:18.34,Default,Live,0,0,0,,and Masaki got canceled for punching someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:20.07,Default,Live,0,0,0,,so Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:20.13,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,97)\fs40\bord4\shad3\fnArial Black\c&HE54789&\3c&H3CFFF3&\4c&H30185D&\frz16.91\pos(135.5,153.5)}Ma{\c&HAE3FDF&}yo{\c&HBAF27D&}naka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:20.13,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(319,97)\fs40\bord4\shad3\fnArial Black\c&HE54789&\3c&H3CFFF3&\4c&H30185D&\frz338.9\pos(520,203)}Pu{\c&HAB41E1&}n{\c&HB6F372&}ch
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.07,0:19:21.97,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Or MayoPan for short!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(237,1)\fs40\fnArial Black\c&H312CE6&\3c&H29487A&\bord4\shad2\4a&H66&\blur0.6\pos(402,55)}MayoPan
