Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:34.51,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now we've made the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:35.73,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That was super easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.06,0:19:40.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Next, we prepare our banner \Nand profile images.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(272,1)\fs18\fax-0.06\fay-0.14\an4\c&H6A6D64&\pos(199.5,215)}Mayonaka Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:45.16,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And now, for the all-important \Nchannel intro video.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:42.61,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\fs36\bord2.5\fnArial Black\c&H84ECF7&\3c&H2628D7&\pos(332,44)}MayoPan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:47.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I mean, we could shoot it on a smartphone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.19,0:19:51.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but we might as well use\N a high-quality camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:52.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:56.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Your intro needs to bring across the \Npersonality of the channel and its members
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:58.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,simply and clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:14.60,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&H7E7E7E&\bord1\pos(320,41.5)}Recording
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.94,0:20:01.42,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:03.29,Default,Live,0,0,0,,This is Live, the leader of the bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.29,0:20:05.32,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Chock-full of energy, it's Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:07.51,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I'm Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.61,0:20:10.48,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:12.22,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:14.75,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:15.10,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&H7E7E7E&\bord1\pos(320,41.5)\c&H1EF757&}Standby
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.10,0:20:18.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now, we import the raw footage \Ninto some video editing software.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:20.03,DefaultItalicsTop,Fu,0,0,0,,I-I'm Fu.
