Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.86,0:20:28.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,477)\fs36\fnArial Black\pos(148,231)\c&HE48925&\3c&HF1F576&\bord2}Fu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:28.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,477)\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H6E225C&\3c&H6E225C&\bord4\4c&H6E225C&\shad1\pos(320,231)}Live
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:28.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,477)\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H6406EB&\3c&HEACCF2&\bord2\pos(320,231)}Live
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:28.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,477)\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H6E225C&\3c&H6E225C&\bord4\4c&H6E225C&\shad1\pos(491,231)}Ichiko
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:28.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,477)\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H6CE742&\3c&HD1FAB0&\bord2\pos(491,231)}Ichiko
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.18,0:20:22.78,DefaultItalicsTop,Fu,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:25.10,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,Here on this channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:30.45,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,we're going to go all out doing whatever \Nwe want—or whatever sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:31.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fad(483,1)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3\pos(319,178.5)\4c&H7C378E&\shad2}Please give a warm welcome\Nto Mayonaka Punch!!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.66,0:20:31.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fad(483,1)\c&H80EEF7&\3c&H6F6F6F&\bord1\pos(319,178.5)}Please give a warm welcome\Nto {\c&H770FB2&\3c&HF1FAF3&}Mayonaka Punch!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.45,0:20:31.62,DefaultItalicsTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:36.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Then edit the photo taken \Nseparately from the video,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:38.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fnArial Black\c&H77019B&\3c&HFAFDFA&\bord2\frz20.03\pos(154,90.5)\shad2\4a&HEE&}The Late-Night
