Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.07,0:20:38.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and there's your thumbnail!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:41.88,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\t(20,1605,\fscx104.06\fscy104.06)\fs14\c&H666966&\move(117,20,110.84,15.47,20,1605)}Upload videos
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:45.39,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Once you have everything ready, \Nupload your video and give it a title.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:45.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx104.06\fscy104.06\t(27,3489,\fscx110.62\fscy110.62)\fs14\c&H666966&\move(106.84,15.47,92.24,4.72,27,3489)}MayoPan Intro
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:48.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fill in the description, tags, \Nand everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:50.63,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It's finally ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:54.02,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Are you okay not being on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:56.52,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(232.5,17)}Breaking: Masakichi fired\NFifth Champion Tanaka: The latest videos were awful.\NAre you two okay?\NIt's me, Hana: Masakichi's out, huh? Makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:57.02,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H433F47&\pos(276,13.5)}stinger{\c&H8D908D&} @chikchik_m3k\NShe wasn't the one I punched, so what's her deal?\NStop playing the victim... So annoying\N\N{\c&H433F47&}stinger{\c&H8D908D&} @chikchik_m3k\NYou seriously can't even do this? So useless
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:20:57.52,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(321,90.5)}gun666: Show yourself, Masakichi\NEye Drops: Go away loser\Nbom777: ggwp\NMa: Why are you two apologizing?\Ntasteless odorless: You might be better off\Ngoing your separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.19,0:20:59.27,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:00.80,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:01.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}fine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If I showed my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.72,0:21:09.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,that Yuki lady might call you out \Nfor associating with a human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.02,0:21:11.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So I'll stay on the production side instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:13.54,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:15.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Okay, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:18.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Time to upload Mayonaka Punch's \Nvery first video.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:28.64,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,It probably won't be like back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:31.27,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not a lot of people will notice us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.91,0:21:34.34,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,But now, I can start fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:38.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This time, I'm not alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Publish video!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:50.49,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1016)\c&H555856&\fs14\3c&HFBFEFB&\bord2\pos(238.5,304.5)}The Chu-Chu Girls. Have Started a New Late-Night Girls' Talk Channel!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:47.63,DefaultItalicsTop,Live,0,0,0,,And so, we'll give it all we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:50.14,DefaultItalicsTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So please subscribe \Nto our channel and leave a like!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.57,0:21:52.73,DefaultItalics,Group,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\an7\c&H141719&\pos(280.5,6.5)}Ichiko\NSent you a sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:16.39,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,97)\fs16\fnComic Sans MS\c&HE6FEE4&\3c&H73D076&\bord1.5\blur1\pos(449,56)}Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.57,0:23:26.27,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.27,0:23:26.65,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,And Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.65,0:23:28.30,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Mannaka Punch has finally started!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:29.09,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.09,0:23:30.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Mannaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.82,0:23:31.93,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:33.78,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm fighting my own alter ego!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.78,0:23:34.93,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Shadowboxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:38.27,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Next time: "A New Member Joins! DEAD or ALIVE"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:38.27,Signs_EpTitle,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H432A23&}A New Member Joins! DEAD or ALIVE
